      "source": "https://www.lompicopark.org/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1915 logging era left the Roaring Camp Railroad, now a tourist line that runs from Felton through the Henry Cowell Redwood Forest to Santa Cruz.",
